	"title": "Locathah Rising",
	"description": "<p><strong>Proceeds from this adventure supplement support the charity Extra Life, for level 9 characters</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;As elemental forces threaten the safety of the nearby locathah communities, heroes rise from among their numbers to strike back and defend their homes and families.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Play as <strong>1 new race</strong>, the Fishfolk Locathah, for use in the Character Builder<br />&bull;&nbsp;Unlocks <strong>6 aquatic monsters</strong> to use in the Encounter Builder to create &amp; run organized battles for your party<br />&bull;&nbsp;<strong>Rollable tables</strong>, <strong>detailed maps</strong>, and <strong>a wealth of stats</strong> to help dungeon masters run this adventure<br /><br />Discover the other books benefiting Extra Life:<br />-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/infernal-machine-rebuild?icid_source=lrmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=imr\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Machine Rebuild</a><br /></span><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">-&nbsp;</span><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/one-grung-above?icid_source=lrmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=oga\" target=\"_blank\">One Grung Above<br /></a></span><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">-&nbsp;</span></span><a href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/mordenkainens-fiendish-folio-volume-1?icid_source=lrmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=mffv1\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">Mordenkainen's Fiendish Folio Vol 1</span><br /></a><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">-&nbsp;</span><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/the-tortle-package?icid_source=lrmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=ttp\" target=\"_blank\">The Tortle Package<br /></a>-&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/lost-laboratory-of-kwalish?icid_source=lrmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=llok\" target=\"_blank\">Lost Laboratory of Kwalish</a></span></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>This purchase unlocks the contents of this source for use with D&amp;D Beyond, including the book in digital format in the game compendium&nbsp;and access options from the book in the searchable listings, character builder, and digital sheet.</p>\r\n<p>Extra Life supports Children's Miracle Network Hospitals&reg; by raising funds and awareness that provide 32 million treatments each year to kids across the U.S. and Canada.</p>",
